Tim May posts:
>Tom and I are in apparent agreement that Robin's system just won't work.
>Even with _reading_ privileges to the Extropians list included (and this
>_is_ readily enforceable...those who are shot simply unsubscribe the list
>for a week or a month or whatever), the basic issue remains that *different
